    "title": "Roger, negative, unable, standby",
    "shortExplanation": "Roger = message received. Negative = no. Unable = I cannot comply. Standby = wait, I will call you back.",
    "example": "Unable, SP-TFA.",
    "whyItMatters": "Unable is the safe answer when an instruction conflicts with VFR or aircraft limits."
  },
